    faq_h: 'FAQ',
    q1: 'Do members pay?', a1: 'No. Members are always free. Only the leader buys a group-size or day pass (or uses an agency voucher) when the group has more than 20 people or the trip is longer than 3 days.',
    q2: 'Do members need the app? Do they need an account?', a2: 'Yes, they need the app — the meetup sound, full-screen meetup card and 3D map all live there. It\'s free to download, with no account, phone number or email required.',
    q3: 'Will it ring on silent or in Focus mode?', a3: 'Meetups are sent as Time Sensitive notifications, delivered on the lock screen and in Focus mode. Allow notifications the first time you open the app. A phone that\'s off or offline can\'t receive them, which is why leaders can see who hasn\'t tapped "Got it".',
