    q8: 'Does it work offline?', a8: 'Meetups, roll calls and seeing your group need an internet connection (mobile data or Wi-Fi). For trips abroad, bring a SIM, eSIM or pocket Wi-Fi. Distance and direction to the meeting point are calculated on your phone.',
    q9: 'When does a group end? Is any data kept?', a9: 'The group ends automatically at 23:59 on the last day, or earlier if the leader ends it. Group data, member list, locations, bubbles, messages and member details are all deleted.',
    q10: 'How do I delete my data?', a10: 'Leaving or ending a group deletes its data; clear your nickname and photo in Settings. For anything else, see <a href="/delete-account">Delete your data</a> or email service.softchip@gmail.com.',
